<title>HONG KONG: CEPA up on third party interest in firm.</title>
<headline>CEPA up on third party interest in firm.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CEPA shares rose sharply in Thursday morning trade after the company said it had been approached by a third party about a possible acquisition of a controlling stake in the company.</p>
<p>Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) said no offer or formal proposal had been received from the third party.</p>
<p>The stock was up HK$0.15 at HK$18.00 on volume of 6.8 million shares in late morning trade.</p>
</text>
